================================================================================
ATTRIBUTION & THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
================================================================================

Fugal is an independent, open reverse-engineering and reimplementation of
the ideas behind Sakana AI's "Fugu" orchestrator family. It is NOT affiliated
with, endorsed by, or derived from Sakana AI's proprietary product code.

This repository derives from the open reverse-engineering effort at
github.com/trotsky1997/OpenFugu (Apache-2.0) and adds the Fugal routing layer
on top of the ideas in its TRINITY reconstruction.

This repository contains ONLY original code, documentation, and analysis
authored by the Fugal contributors. It deliberately does NOT redistribute any
third-party source, weights, or datasets. The one third-party artifact it uses
is fetched at setup time by `scripts/fetch_backbone.py`, directly from its
original source:

1. TRINITY: An Evolved LLM Coordinator (arXiv:2512.04695), Sakana AI.
   Fugal's router design derives from this work. Fugal does not depend on any
   TRINITY artifact at runtime: it runs on an unmodified Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B
   backbone with its own 17-model head. This is an acknowledgement, not a
   dependency.

2. Learning to Orchestrate Agents in Natural Language with the Conductor
   (arXiv:2512.04388), Sakana AI. Referenced for the Conductor mechanism.

3. Backbone model: Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B (Apache-2.0), Alibaba Cloud. Downloaded
   from HuggingFace at setup time; never redistributed here.

4. Worker pool: any model reachable through OpenRouter. Credentials are
   supplied by the user via environment variables, never stored, never logged.

================================================================================
TRAINED WEIGHTS
================================================================================

The router head (`data/router_head.npz`) is original work of this project: a
linear utility head fit offline against this project's own model x question
evidence matrix. It is distributed under Apache-2.0 with the rest of this
repository. See `docs/HEAD_FORMAT.md` for its contract.
